I.D. No. 46-09060

<br><br>
Accident Investigators
<br><br>

Jan B. Lyall<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector - Roof Control
<br><br>
Craig S. Aaron<br>
Mining Engineer - Health 
<br><br>
Jerry W. Vance<br>
Mine Health and Safety Specialist (Training)
